  "releaseNotes": "Adds a log engine, enabled by the host with builder.AddLogServer(). It records data audit of modules in the same transaction as the data, engine audit of sign-in, passwords, users, roles, robots, settings and deletions, and telemetry (diagnostic lines, errors grouped by fingerprint, request access lines and logs sent by WPF/MAUI clients). Database scripts must be installed before the engine is enabled, and module audit groups are registered with builder.AddAudit().\n\nFull release note: https://github.com/MatrixCode-ID/em-system/blob/v0.1.0-alpha.11/doc/ReleaseNote/EmSys.Api.Core/0.1.0-alpha.11.md",
